{'symbol': 'WY', 'date': '2022-04-14 16:30:00', 'title': 'WEYERHAEUSER TO ACQUIRE TIMBERLANDS IN NORTH AND SOUTH CAROLINA', 'text': 'SEATTLE , APRIL 14, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- WEYERHAEUSER COMPANY (NYSE: WY) TODAY ANNOUNCED AN AGREEMENT TO PURCHASE 80,800 ACRES OF HIGH-QUALITY TIMBERLANDS IN NORTH AND SOUTH CAROLINA FROM A FUND MANAGED BY CAMPBELL GLOBAL FOR APPROXIMATELY $265 MILLION. THE ACQUISITION IS COMPRISED OF HIGHLY PRODUCTIVE TIMBERLANDS SITUATED IN STRONG COASTAL MARKETS AND STRATEGICALLY LOCATED TO DELIVER IMMEDIATE SYNERGIES WITH EXISTING WEYERHAEUSER TIMBER AND MILL OPERATIONS.'}